<h1>How it compares</h1>

<p class="lede">I administered a homelab from a Mac and bought the
alternatives first. Every one ended the same way: a terminal open beside it,
because no window would answer the question—what, exactly, is
about to run, and where. This chart keeps the cells the others win.</p>

